<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:32:57 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>亚马逊并没有放弃杰夫·贝索斯 (Jeff Bezos) 的无人机送货梦想，在经历了 13 年的动荡之后，势头终于发生了转变</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/amazon-isnt-giving-up-on-jeff-bezos-drone-deliveries-dreamand-after-13-years-of-turbulence-the-momentum-is-finally-shifting/</link><description>这家电子商务巨头宣布，到今年年底，将把无人机送货服务扩展到美国近 500 个城镇，比目前的能力增加六倍。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287919597-e1787163786383.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:38:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/amazon-isnt-giving-up-on-jeff-bezos-drone-deliveries-dreamand-after-13-years-of-turbulence-the-momentum-is-finally-shifting/</guid></item><item><title>比特币意外上涨，自 6 月份以来首次接近 70,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/bitcoin-surprise-rally-since-june/</link><description>美国财政部的债券回购公告帮助比特币上涨了近 6%，一位分析师表示更广泛的复苏可能正在进行中。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1329055819-e1787177673458.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:18:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/bitcoin-surprise-rally-since-june/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌和英国认为改变航班路径可以减少气候变化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/google-ai-airplane-contrails/</link><description>一项为期 30 个月、耗资 676 万美元的试验将使大西洋上空的数百架航班偏离航线，以测试是否可以通过基因工程消除尾迹。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26229755064984-e1787172427675.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:17:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/google-ai-airplane-contrails/</guid></item><item><title>价值 80 亿美元的网络安全收购帮助 ServiceNow 的股票摆脱了“Saaspocalypse”的担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/armis-wiz-8-billion-cybersecurity-acquisition-servicenow-saaspocalypse/</link><description>叶夫根尼·迪布罗夫 (Yevgeny Dibrov) 的 Armis 的交易是以色列有史以来第二大科技初创企业退出交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Avishag-Shaar-Yashuv-365.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 06:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/armis-wiz-8-billion-cybersecurity-acquisition-servicenow-saaspocalypse/</guid></item><item><title>五角大楼对“损害我们国家安全”的外国大学合作伙伴关系实行“零容忍”审计</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/pentagon-audit-foreign-university-partnerships-national-security/</link><description>学校必须完成审查并终止被认为有问题的安排，否则将面临资金损失。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2212179187-e1787172837486.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:12:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/pentagon-audit-foreign-university-partnerships-national-security/</guid></item><item><title>地缘政治风险需要远离“餐后演讲者”：欧亚集团和力拓集团的多米尼克·巴顿</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/geopolitical-risk-after-dinner-speaker-eurasia-group-dominic-barton-08-19-2026/</link><description>欧亚集团顾问多米尼克·巴顿表示，在关税和新限制的背景下，企业领导人不能再将地缘政治视为董事会的余兴节目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274218083-e1786950597857.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/geopolitical-risk-after-dinner-speaker-eurasia-group-dominic-barton-08-19-2026/</guid></item><item><title>Moderna 和默克公司的个性化 mRNA 疫苗在后期试验中显示出对抗致命皮肤癌黑色素瘤的真正希望，并导致股价飙升</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/moderna-merck-mrna-vaccine-promise-deadly-skin-cancer-melanoma-stocks-08-19-2026/</link><description>在一项对 1,100 多名患者进行的试验中，该注射剂与默克公司的 Keytruda 配合使用，降低了黑色素瘤复发的风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1836124344-e1787156329838.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:47:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/moderna-merck-mrna-vaccine-promise-deadly-skin-cancer-melanoma-stocks-08-19-2026/</guid></item><item><title>国债突破40万亿美元，智库警告：“财政管理不善的程度是悲剧性的”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/how-much-is-national-debt-40-trillion/</link><description>迈克尔·彼得森对《财富》杂志表示：“在我看来，对于任何关心美国、民主和我们未来的人来说，这已经是一场危机。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2284670134-e1787172391892.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:24:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/how-much-is-national-debt-40-trillion/</guid></item><item><title>美国顶级儿童医院新任院长看到儿童癌症治疗“新时代的曙光”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/st-jude-ceo-childhood-cancer-research-tech-advancement/</link><description>St. Jude 首席执行官 Charles WM Roberts 博士表示，他相信这是实现儿童癌症治疗梦想的“千载难逢的机会”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26229795207544-e1787171990664.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:46:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/st-jude-ceo-childhood-cancer-research-tech-advancement/</guid></item><item><title>吉米·金梅尔与特朗普的不和升级为美国广播公司起诉美国联邦通信委员会，指控其广播许可证受到威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/abc-disney-fcc-freedom-of-speech-lawsuit/</link><description>“政府一次又一次地攻击美国广播公司的言论——其记者报道的故事及其网络节目播出的观点。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26212629566037-e1787167732179.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 19:46:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/abc-disney-fcc-freedom-of-speech-lawsuit/</guid></item></channel></rss>